## The quoted texts are NOT covered by this licence

"The Book of Discipline of The United Methodist Church" (2020/2024) is
(c) The United Methodist Publishing House. The text of Petition 21039 is the
work of the General Conference of The United Methodist Church. Wroot Labs
claims no copyright in either and grants no rights over either. They are quoted
on this site for commentary and explanation.

Specifically NOT licensed here: the contents of the `textOld` and `textNew`
fields in src/content/paragraphs/*.yaml, the corresponding text rendered on
every /p/[n] page, and the archived PDFs under sources/.

Claiming a licence over someone else's copyrighted text would be meaningless,
and claiming one over a text we did not write is worse than meaningless.

## The editorial work IS covered

Everything else in this repository is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0):
